SDUSD::setRewarder
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new rewarder is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with SDUSDZeroAddress
    ├── when new rewarder equals the current rewarder
    │   └── it should revert with SDUSDNoStateChange
    └── when new rewarder is a different non-zero address
        ├── it should update rewarder
        └── it should emit RewarderUpdated with old and new rewarder
